&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;aria-label&lt;/code&gt; on the remove button is critical. "Remove" alone is ambiguous — "Remove email 2: &lt;a href="mailto:user@example.com"&gt;user@example.com&lt;/a&gt;" is unambiguous.&lt;/p&gt;




