  Quick Start
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a baseline Core Web Vitals audit:
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight shell"&gt;&lt;code&gt;npx unlighthouse &lt;span class="nt"&gt;--site&lt;/span&gt; https://your-app.example.com
